# Content profiles: container form x place family (candidate).
# frequency_class rule (FREQ_RULE, README):
#   ubiquitous = the content is a REQUIRED item of a matcult scene for that place
#   common     = the content of that container/place is named explicitly in an A/B source
#   contextual = named only in a draft/candidate source (rus13tpl, MASTER spawn) or a C source
#   rare       = only v5/author compatibility + place function (no source naming it)
# qty in packing slots of the container (<= capacity_slots). pf "*" = carried/any place.
# entry: (content_category, frequency_class, qty_min, qty_max, example_items(matcult ids, |), basis_ref)

def E(cat, fc, qmin, qmax, ex, basis):
    return (cat, fc, qmin, qmax, ex, basis)


